{"availability":"available","full":"kyan9400/opsmind","name":"opsmind","description":"Live demo: opsmind-demo.vercel.app — multi-tenant AI operations & knowledge platform: hybrid RAG with cited answers (pgvector + full text), KPI dashboards with anomaly detection, EN/RU/AR. Next.js, Express, FastAPI, Postgres. 14-job CI, Helm, Terraform, k6.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-26T08:57:47Z","updated":"2026-10-08T17:56:33Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://opsmind-demo.vercel.app","topics":["anomaly-detection","docker","fastapi","github-actions","helm","kubernetes","llm","multi-tenant","nextjs","opentelemetry","pgvector","playwright","postgresql","python","rag","redis","supabase","terraform","typescript","vercel"],"demo":"https://opsmind-demo.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:21.360Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:21.360Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:21.360Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T18:25:21.360Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A multi-tenant operations and knowledge platform for small businesses: cited AI answers from company documents, KPI dashboards that flag anomalies, and the CI/CD, Kubernetes and observability to run it.","Live demo: opsmind-demo.vercel.app. Click Try the live demo to sign in as a read-only viewer. It is the real stack running serverless: Next.js and the Express API on Vercel, the Python AI service on Vercel, and Postgres + pgvector on Supabase (setup). It is checked daily by the live check. Some networks in Russia block .vercel.app; if it does not open, use the preview below.","Interactive preview: hass-ak.sourcecraft.site/opsmind. It opens instantly with recorded demo data and no server, and it is clearly labelled as a preview (how it works)."],"features":["Tests: 57 API tests (9 of them against a real Postgres), 48 AI-service tests (3 against pgvector) and 6 Playwright browser tests, which run twice: directly and through the Codespaces proxy.","Pipeline: 12 jobs on every pull request and every push to main, from unit tests to a Helm install on kind and a dev-container boot (list).","Load: k6 with 50 virtual users, 0 errors, p95 between 3.1 ms (documents) and 9.4 ms (ask) per endpoint in a typical run, against budgets of 100–800 ms. This uses the offline providers (hash embeddings, extractive…","Retrieval: on 56 labelled questions over 12 documents in English, Russian and Arabic, hybrid search reaches Recall@5 85.7% and MRR@10 0.763 with the offline hash embedder (details)."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kyan9400/opsmind/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"88161ef2ed53500b6b9a31c48651db1bc02b8ece525d711e5175c877ab623659","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:21.494Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:21.494Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A multi-tenant operations and knowledge platform for small businesses: cited AI answers from company documents, KPI dashboards that flag anomalies, and the CI/CD, Kubernetes and observability to run it.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kyan9400/opsmind/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Click Try the live demo to sign in as a read-only viewer.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kyan9400/opsmind/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Try the full system: open the repo in GitHub Codespaces and sign in with Try the live demo or demo@opsmind.dev / opsmind-demo (a read-only viewer).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kyan9400/opsmind/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"The offline defaults need no API keys, so CI and a fresh docker compose up work out of the box.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kyan9400/opsmind/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"88161ef2ed53500b6b9a31c48651db1bc02b8ece525d711e5175c877ab623659","sourceUrl":"ht